  m_Name: Note02_LeverProgress
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ItemData
  itemName: Security Notice
  itemDescription: The way forward
  fullNoteContent: 'Notice to all employees,As of today installation of our new emergency
    system has been completed, this memo serves strictly as an introduction as to
    how the new system works, emergency protocols and how to act in the event of
    an emergency will be given shortly after receiving this memo.


    This new
    system is designed to close and section off rooms in S4 in the event that a specimen
    escapes and is loose in the facility, this is done using metal gates that will
    close and block off certain rooms to corner and limit the specimen''s options
    in escaping.All staff are to act in accordance to their respective department''s
    emergency protocols and find the nearest emergency exit or in the event of none
    being nearby find the room designated as the safe room and remaining there until
    further notice.In addition override levers have been installed to these safe
    rooms in order to lift the lockdown after the event has ended.


    Attached
    to this memo is the location of the nearest safe rooms and override levers to
    your department.


    There are 3 override levers located in your area of S4:Staff
    Room,Security Office,Laboratory Observation Room'
  type: 1
  icon: {fileID: 0}
